{"2841390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ava Hunt and Thieves of the Lost", "steam_appid": 2841390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world feels older than you — and it’s not happy you’re there.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ava Hunt and Thieves of the Lost</strong> is a grounded, cinematic, story-driven survival experience where mystery unfolds through atmosphere and consequence.<br>You’re chasing something powerful — and the deeper you go, the harder the ruins push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/491f01f764839536d425ceffd1aa542a.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/491f01f764839536d425ceffd1aa542a.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/491f01f764839536d425ceffd1aa542a.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical, momentum-driven movement: </strong>Move with intent — read the space, commit to every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere-led discovery: </strong>The mystery unfolds through space, silence, and cinematic detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Measured stealth and positioning: </strong>Timing matters. So does restraint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension over noise: </strong>Combat is a choice — not the only way forward. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f23537569ed4fad271f3ea7341ecfff5.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/f23537569ed4fad271f3ea7341ecfff5.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hostile ruins, survive escalating enemy pressure, solve traversal and environmental mysteries, and uncover fragments of a forgotten civilization — while rival factions and something far darker close in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every relic you uncover strengthens Ava — and <strong>pushes the world to respond.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f76f4b623ec08daff84f7886dc8db135.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f76f4b623ec08daff84f7886dc8db135.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f76f4b623ec08daff84f7886dc8db135.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Among ancient jungles and forgotten ruins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten sanctuaries, collapsed chambers, hidden passages, and environments shaped by an unknown Ethernal civilization buried beneath the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5ac9dcd558e9ae8f0714aacd5c416a4e.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5ac9dcd558e9ae8f0714aacd5c416a4e.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5ac9dcd558e9ae8f0714aacd5c416a4e.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resonant Relics System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are more than collectibles. They awaken memories, grant abilities, and expose fragments of lost history — but every use leaves an echo that doesn’t fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/1c9f2c6975574d50ad84d4a3eac5cadf.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/1c9f2c6975574d50ad84d4a3eac5cadf.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=776 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Enemy Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react to movement, sound, and proximity. Positioning matters, stealth is rewarded, and exposure is punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all hunters work alone. <strong>Enigma</strong> operates with purpose and resources — backed by the <strong>Thieves of the Lost</strong>, and sent to reclaim what should never surface.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/92cdc642f3c854246ee4d29330c70709.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/92cdc642f3c854246ee4d29330c70709.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/92cdc642f3c854246ee4d29330c70709.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world dictates your movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable ruins, ancient mechanisms, and vertical spaces that demand instinct over precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world shifts as you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eca6f25c8ca48f89f0778613c4a35598.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eca6f25c8ca48f89f0778613c4a35598.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eca6f25c8ca48f89f0778613c4a35598.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ruins don’t open — they test you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push through collapsing passages as ancient stones fight to stay sealed. Beyond the danger lie forgotten treasures — and truths meant to remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e7a3e622c9dca4503b03b509e865d34a.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e7a3e622c9dca4503b03b509e865d34a.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e7a3e622c9dca4503b03b509e865d34a.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress demands motion.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hesitation is punished, and instinct keeps you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move forward as the world collapses behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/41b1571cc2d584864acb9e956581642e.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/41b1571cc2d584864acb9e956581642e.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/41b1571cc2d584864acb9e956581642e.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The scene above is from the upcoming chapter, &quot;<i>Hudson: Ironworks.&quot; </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nothing is told — <strong>everything is felt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant voice follows Ava as the Signal grows stronger — and the ruins begin to answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/0ace6d5613e63dd642da3135418707cc.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/0ace6d5613e63dd642da3135418707cc.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/0ace6d5613e63dd642da3135418707cc.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Forces Closing In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For millennia, the Thieves of the Lost have watched from the shadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ava draws closer to forbidden truths, their reach tightens — and Enigma is sent to claim what should never surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5c7b3637ee137de96118a1b705ba4ab1.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/5c7b3637ee137de96118a1b705ba4ab1.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But Enigma isn’t the only threat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As relic resonance intensifies, <strong>the Gloom awakens</strong> — twisted remnants of something that should never have existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not mindless. They sense energy, movement, presence — reacting to Ava’s actions… and to Enigma’s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every faction is drawn to the same truth: <strong>the Relics. The Ethernal Flame</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/ec6875aaa2d63c64a3f08dd9b31e59bc.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/ec6875aaa2d63c64a3f08dd9b31e59bc.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/ec6875aaa2d63c64a3f08dd9b31e59bc.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resonance Mastery &amp; Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ava’s bond with the relics deepens through <strong>Resonance Mastery</strong> — an evolving ability system shaped by the forces she awakens. New powers, passive traits, and subtle upgrades emerge as Ava resonates more deeply with the ruins — and as the world begins to respond in kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access, this system lays its foundation: relic awakenings, growing resonance, and escalating consequences as Ava ventures further into forbidden depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eb6f77adcea8bbcc1d8fb4479ce18a8d.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/eb6f77adcea8bbcc1d8fb4479ce18a8d.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=756 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Codex of Constellations — Relics System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics in <strong>Ava Hunt</strong> form a living constellation web inside the <strong>Codex of Constellations</strong>.<br>Each Relic unlocks lore fragments, Resonance effects, and new progression routes — revealing a larger pattern tied to the Ethernal Flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics follow distinct paths, allowing non-linear progression and meaningful choice as Ava evolves.<br>The deeper you resonate, the more secrets emerge — and the more dangerous the hunt becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e8bb0bf9f8d5616c5aab1a9aac69a7ab.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/e8bb0bf9f8d5616c5aab1a9aac69a7ab.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factions &amp; Threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics form a living constellation within the <strong>Codex of Constellations</strong> — a web of symbols, memories, and latent power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each discovery reveals fragments of lost history, deepens Resonance, and opens new paths forward — hinting at a larger pattern tied to the <strong>Ethernal Flame</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is never linear. The deeper Ava resonates, the more secrets surface — and the more dangerous the hunt becomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/064458aef9f57ae540f052f4d1b93826.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/064458aef9f57ae540f052f4d1b93826.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/064458aef9f57ae540f052f4d1b93826.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scene above is from a chapter in development, &quot;<i>Aethyr: The Eternal Realm&quot;.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World &amp; Chapters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ava Hunt unfolds across a growing world of ancient ruins, lost places, and modern shadows — each location revealing a deeper layer of the mystery at its core. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access begins with the opening chapters, establishing the foundations of the story, its forces, and the choices that shape Ava’s path. As development continues, the narrative expands through future updates, pushing the journey into darker truths and higher stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Release Chapters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Eternals: Echoes Before Time</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prologue: The Awakening</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chapter I: Gate of Ten Thousand Years</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapters in Development</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hunt Manor: The Lost File</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Summit of Shadows</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadow Keep: The Alpine Conclave</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hudson Ironworks</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Transfer: New York</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aethyr: The Eternal Realm</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across these chapters, the experience evolves from grounded exploration and survival into conspiracies, secret orders, and a looming conflict over the Ethernal Flame — where every step forward reshapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hunt is only <strong>beginning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/4e9f7a791c6882f2c880108562a6d437.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/4e9f7a791c6882f2c880108562a6d437.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/4e9f7a791c6882f2c880108562a6d437.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The scene</i> above is from the &quot;<i>Shadow Keep: The Alpine Conclave&quot;, </i>an upcoming chapter in development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Release Snapshot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This initial release lays the foundation of Ava’s hunt — introducing the world, its forces, and the systems that will continue to evolve as the story unfolds. Future updates will expand the experience with new chapters, enemies, abilities, and deeper systemic reactions as Ava pushes further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong> Movement, combat, and interaction are tuned for controller play, with full keyboard and mouse support for those who prefer precision. Custom key rebinding is planned for a future update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/874fc5be6f2a5f2217db24526e5f022a.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/874fc5be6f2a5f2217db24526e5f022a.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/874fc5be6f2a5f2217db24526e5f022a.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The story continues </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New chapters, locations, and systems will unfold as Ava’s hunt deepens — leading toward a final confrontation tied to the Eternal Flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/d5eb03c8d3691812c7a321913b27fbae.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/d5eb03c8d3691812c7a321913b27fbae.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/d5eb03c8d3691812c7a321913b27fbae.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>The scene above is a preview from the &quot;Hudson Irownworks&quot; chapter in development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The hunt doesn’t end with what you uncover — i<strong>t deepens with what you awaken.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world feels older than you — and it’s not happy you’re there.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ava Hunt and Thieves of the Lost</strong> is a grounded, cinematic, story-driven survival experience where mystery unfolds through atmosphere and consequence.<br>You’re chasing something powerful — and the deeper you go, the harder the ruins push back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/491f01f764839536d425ceffd1aa542a.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/491f01f764839536d425ceffd1aa542a.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/491f01f764839536d425ceffd1aa542a.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical, momentum-driven movement: </strong>Move with intent — read the space, commit to every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmosphere-led discovery: </strong>The mystery unfolds through space, silence, and cinematic detail.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Measured stealth and positioning: </strong>Timing matters. So does restraint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension over noise: </strong>Combat is a choice — not the only way forward. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f23537569ed4fad271f3ea7341ecfff5.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/f23537569ed4fad271f3ea7341ecfff5.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=974 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hostile ruins, survive escalating enemy pressure, solve traversal and environmental mysteries, and uncover fragments of a forgotten civilization — while rival factions and something far darker close in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every relic you uncover strengthens Ava — and <strong>pushes the world to respond.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f76f4b623ec08daff84f7886dc8db135.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f76f4b623ec08daff84f7886dc8db135.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/f76f4b623ec08daff84f7886dc8db135.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Among ancient jungles and forgotten ruins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forgotten sanctuaries, collapsed chambers, hidden passages, and environments shaped by an unknown Ethernal civilization buried beneath the modern world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5ac9dcd558e9ae8f0714aacd5c416a4e.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5ac9dcd558e9ae8f0714aacd5c416a4e.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5ac9dcd558e9ae8f0714aacd5c416a4e.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resonant Relics System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics are more than collectibles. They awaken memories, grant abilities, and expose fragments of lost history — but every use leaves an echo that doesn’t fade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/1c9f2c6975574d50ad84d4a3eac5cadf.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/1c9f2c6975574d50ad84d4a3eac5cadf.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=776 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Enemy Encounters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies react to movement, sound, and proximity. Positioning matters, stealth is rewarded, and exposure is punished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all hunters work alone. <strong>Enigma</strong> operates with purpose and resources — backed by the <strong>Thieves of the Lost</strong>, and sent to reclaim what should never surface.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/92cdc642f3c854246ee4d29330c70709.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/92cdc642f3c854246ee4d29330c70709.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/92cdc642f3c854246ee4d29330c70709.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The world dictates your movement</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unstable ruins, ancient mechanisms, and vertical spaces that demand instinct over precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world shifts as you move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eca6f25c8ca48f89f0778613c4a35598.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eca6f25c8ca48f89f0778613c4a35598.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eca6f25c8ca48f89f0778613c4a35598.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ruins don’t open — they test you.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push through collapsing passages as ancient stones fight to stay sealed. Beyond the danger lie forgotten treasures — and truths meant to remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e7a3e622c9dca4503b03b509e865d34a.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e7a3e622c9dca4503b03b509e865d34a.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e7a3e622c9dca4503b03b509e865d34a.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress demands motion.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hesitation is punished, and instinct keeps you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move forward as the world collapses behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/41b1571cc2d584864acb9e956581642e.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/41b1571cc2d584864acb9e956581642e.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/41b1571cc2d584864acb9e956581642e.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The scene above is from the upcoming chapter, &quot;<i>Hudson: Ironworks.&quot; </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nothing is told — <strong>everything is felt</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distant voice follows Ava as the Signal grows stronger — and the ruins begin to answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/0ace6d5613e63dd642da3135418707cc.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/0ace6d5613e63dd642da3135418707cc.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/0ace6d5613e63dd642da3135418707cc.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Forces Closing In</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For millennia, the Thieves of the Lost have watched from the shadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ava draws closer to forbidden truths, their reach tightens — and Enigma is sent to claim what should never surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/5c7b3637ee137de96118a1b705ba4ab1.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/5c7b3637ee137de96118a1b705ba4ab1.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=790 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But Enigma isn’t the only threat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As relic resonance intensifies, <strong>the Gloom awakens</strong> — twisted remnants of something that should never have existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not mindless. They sense energy, movement, presence — reacting to Ava’s actions… and to Enigma’s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every faction is drawn to the same truth: <strong>the Relics. The Ethernal Flame</strong>.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/ec6875aaa2d63c64a3f08dd9b31e59bc.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/ec6875aaa2d63c64a3f08dd9b31e59bc.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/ec6875aaa2d63c64a3f08dd9b31e59bc.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Resonance Mastery &amp; Abilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ava’s bond with the relics deepens through <strong>Resonance Mastery</strong> — an evolving ability system shaped by the forces she awakens. New powers, passive traits, and subtle upgrades emerge as Ava resonates more deeply with the ruins — and as the world begins to respond in kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Early Access, this system lays its foundation: relic awakenings, growing resonance, and escalating consequences as Ava ventures further into forbidden depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/eb6f77adcea8bbcc1d8fb4479ce18a8d.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/eb6f77adcea8bbcc1d8fb4479ce18a8d.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=756 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Codex of Constellations — Relics System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics in <strong>Ava Hunt</strong> form a living constellation web inside the <strong>Codex of Constellations</strong>.<br>Each Relic unlocks lore fragments, Resonance effects, and new progression routes — revealing a larger pattern tied to the Ethernal Flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics follow distinct paths, allowing non-linear progression and meaningful choice as Ava evolves.<br>The deeper you resonate, the more secrets emerge — and the more dangerous the hunt becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/e8bb0bf9f8d5616c5aab1a9aac69a7ab.avif?t=1780601858\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras_big/e8bb0bf9f8d5616c5aab1a9aac69a7ab.avif?t=1780601858 width=1560 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Factions &amp; Threats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relics form a living constellation within the <strong>Codex of Constellations</strong> — a web of symbols, memories, and latent power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each discovery reveals fragments of lost history, deepens Resonance, and opens new paths forward — hinting at a larger pattern tied to the <strong>Ethernal Flame</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress is never linear. The deeper Ava resonates, the more secrets surface — and the more dangerous the hunt becomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/064458aef9f57ae540f052f4d1b93826.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/064458aef9f57ae540f052f4d1b93826.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/064458aef9f57ae540f052f4d1b93826.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The scene above is from a chapter in development, &quot;<i>Aethyr: The Eternal Realm&quot;.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World &amp; Chapters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ava Hunt unfolds across a growing world of ancient ruins, lost places, and modern shadows — each location revealing a deeper layer of the mystery at its core. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access begins with the opening chapters, establishing the foundations of the story, its forces, and the choices that shape Ava’s path. As development continues, the narrative expands through future updates, pushing the journey into darker truths and higher stakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Early Release Chapters</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Eternals: Echoes Before Time</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Prologue: The Awakening</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chapter I: Gate of Ten Thousand Years</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chapters in Development</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hunt Manor: The Lost File</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Summit of Shadows</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Shadow Keep: The Alpine Conclave</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hudson Ironworks</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Transfer: New York</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Aethyr: The Eternal Realm</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across these chapters, the experience evolves from grounded exploration and survival into conspiracies, secret orders, and a looming conflict over the Ethernal Flame — where every step forward reshapes what comes next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hunt is only <strong>beginning.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/4e9f7a791c6882f2c880108562a6d437.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/4e9f7a791c6882f2c880108562a6d437.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/4e9f7a791c6882f2c880108562a6d437.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The scene</i> above is from the &quot;<i>Shadow Keep: The Alpine Conclave&quot;, </i>an upcoming chapter in development.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Release Snapshot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This initial release lays the foundation of Ava’s hunt — introducing the world, its forces, and the systems that will continue to evolve as the story unfolds. Future updates will expand the experience with new chapters, enemies, abilities, and deeper systemic reactions as Ava pushes further into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls:</strong> Movement, combat, and interaction are tuned for controller play, with full keyboard and mouse support for those who prefer precision. Custom key rebinding is planned for a future update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/874fc5be6f2a5f2217db24526e5f022a.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/874fc5be6f2a5f2217db24526e5f022a.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/874fc5be6f2a5f2217db24526e5f022a.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The story continues </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New chapters, locations, and systems will unfold as Ava’s hunt deepens — leading toward a final confrontation tied to the Eternal Flame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/d5eb03c8d3691812c7a321913b27fbae.poster.avif?t=1780601858\" width=1000 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/d5eb03c8d3691812c7a321913b27fbae.webm?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/extras/d5eb03c8d3691812c7a321913b27fbae.mp4?t=1780601858\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>The scene above is a preview from the &quot;Hudson Irownworks&quot; chapter in development.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The hunt doesn’t end with what you uncover — i<strong>t deepens with what you awaken.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "The ruins don’t open. They push back.— A grounded, cinematic survival experience where every move matters — and hesitation is punished.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2841390/969e6d77e62ac976899ddf391